language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

contract OperatorBrowserContract.
interface OperatorBrowserInterface.
message-set OperatorBrowserRequests.
message-set OperatorBrowserResponses.

OperatorBrowserInterface follows OperatorBrowserContract.
OperatorBrowserContract allows OperatorBrowserRequests.
OperatorBrowserContract specifies "Versioned JSON WebSocket plus specified REST snapshot/config/export/recovery. BWEB retains independent Machine and Bucking routes, identities and degraded state.".
OperatorBrowserContract status proposed.
OperatorBrowserContract allows OperatorBrowserResponses.
OperatorBrowserRequests describes "OperatorBrowser incoming message family; exact allowed variants follow the cited schema or the associated contract gap.".
OperatorBrowserResponses describes "OperatorBrowser outgoing message family; payload schema and variant routing need the declared contract.".
